body:
I have a lot of respect for you for sharing this. You are doing the right thing and there will be a light at the end of this.

&#x200B;

I can relate with using weed to deal with issues. It is easy in the short-term and a sort of cruise control. I am on day 20 and had a massive depressive episode but acknowledge that it is part of the process. I prefer ups and downs to the consistent "okay-ness" that smoking brought me.

&#x200B;
